@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #F7F9FC
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #4765A1
  LifeLineBorderColor #B4C2DB
  ParticipantBorderColor #A6B5C7
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
}
title Fluxo de sucesso: Saga orquestrada
autonumber
actor "Cliente" as C
participant "Order Service" as O
queue "RabbitMQ" as B
participant "Saga Orchestrator" as S
participant "Inventory Service" as I
participant "Payment Service" as P
participant "Gateway Financeiro" as G

legend bottom
  Setas assíncronas passam pelo RabbitMQ.
  HTTP do cliente e HTTPS com o gateway são síncronos.
endlegend

C -> O: POST /orders (Idempotency-Key)
O --> C: 202 Accepted (PENDING)
O ->> B: OrderCreated (Outbox Relay)
B ->> S: OrderCreated
S ->> B: ReserveStock
B ->> I: ReserveStock
I ->> B: StockReserved(reservationId, expiresAt)
B ->> S: StockReserved
S ->> B: ChargePayment(paymentOperationId)
B ->> P: ChargePayment
P -> G: HTTPS cobrança + chave idempotente
G --> P: CHARGED(transactionId)
P ->> B: PaymentCharged
B ->> S: PaymentCharged
S ->> B: AllocateStock(reservationId)
B ->> I: AllocateStock
I ->> B: StockAllocated
B ->> S: StockAllocated
S ->> B: ConfirmOrder
B ->> O: ConfirmOrder
O ->> B: OrderConfirmed
B ->> S: OrderConfirmed (Saga COMPLETED)
C -> O: GET /orders/{id}
O --> C: CONFIRMED

@enduml
